      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be great to see, and I also have a feature request that would help this issue out a lot here:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/add-caching-options-for-vrcimage-string-videodownloader-components-to-skip-reque\n\nIf the content was cached there wouldn't be a reason for the cooldown after a user already encountered those URLs.  This would make using external media and dynamic content a lot more reasonable.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
